How equal is equal opportunity? This project visualises the "wall" that someone could see when looking at the world from their own country.

The bricks vanish as you choose your country — a metaphor for your openness to travel. Countries highlighted on the map show where you can go freely; the remaining ones would require a visa application. The fewer bricks, the more you can travel.\
\
